    <item>
      <title>Bristol–Uganda Collaborative Training Visit on Health Data Science</title>
      <link>https://babichmorrowc.github.io/teaching/bristol_uganda_data_week/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://babichmorrowc.github.io/teaching/bristol_uganda_data_week/</guid>
      <description>In June 2026, members of MIHRI (the Mayuge Institute for Global Health Sciences Research and Innovation) visited Bristol for Bristol Data Week. I prepared training materials for overall data science skills, including Git/GitHub and R, as well as probabilistic data linkage. You can find all of the materials in the following GitHub repository: https://github.com/babichmorrowc/bristol-uganda-data-week. If you have any questions about these resources, please let me know!</description>
